 "arrive_text": "Noviodunum of the Aedui sits on its bluff above the Liger, a town of thatch and smoke like any other. Below it, on the flat by the river, is the thing that isn't like any other: a square of ditch and stakes with Roman sentries at the gate. Behind the stakes are Caesar's grain, his baggage, his remounts, his pay chest, and the children every people in Gaul handed over to keep its word.",
